# Dokuchi Silencer: only "combat damage to a player" triggers it (CR 120.3c: damage to a planeswalker is dealt to it). Black Lotus pays for the Silencer on turn 1;
# Bot2 casts Liliana of the Veil on turn 2. On turn 3 the Silencer attacks Liliana (loyalty 3 - 2 = 1): nothing is asked
# (! Bot1.Choose) and the Firebrand stays in hand. On turn 5 it attacks Bot2 and the discard is made; the reflexive
# trigger's target, a planeswalker the player dealt the damage controls (CR 603.12), is Liliana, who is destroyed.

